00:42:21,728 --> 00:42:25,101
I cannot give it up, I cannot break my promise.

590
00:42:25,617 --> 00:42:28,183
They told him, No, you have to stop it.

591
00:42:28,399 --> 00:42:29,625
Anyway, they had to dispute.

592
00:42:29,854 --> 00:42:31,488
How can they solve this dispute?

593
00:42:32,599 --> 00:42:33,940
Let's go to the witch.

594
00:42:35,633 --> 00:42:38,070
So, they decided to go and visit the witch again.

595
00:42:38,173 --> 00:42:40,697
They went to the witch and they told her,

596
00:42:40,848 --> 00:42:42,062
this is the situation.

597
00:42:42,197 --> 00:42:46,522
She said, All right, come back to me tomorrow, so that I can consult my spirits, this evening.

598
00:42:47,014 --> 00:42:48,316
Tonight, I'll speak to the Jinn.

599
00:42:49,379 --> 00:42:51,959
They came back the next day and she had an answer for them.

600
00:42:52,459 --> 00:42:53,465
She told them.

601
00:42:53,861 --> 00:42:58,486
 What is the retribution that you pay, to a person that was killed?,

602
00:42:58,583 --> 00:42:59,181
 Diya(دية),

603
00:42:59,871 --> 00:43:01,625
the blood money, how much is it?

604
00:43:03,133 --> 00:43:04,530
They said 10 camels.

605
00:43:05,617 --> 00:43:08,258
She said then put 10 camels on one side

606
00:43:08,570 --> 00:43:11,550
and put Abdullah(عبدالله) on the other side and cast a lot.

607
00:43:12,990 --> 00:43:16,689
If it points towards the camels, then slaughter the camels,

608
00:43:17,149 --> 00:43:20,799
if it points towards Abdullah(عبدالله), then add another 10 camels.

609
00:43:22,800 --> 00:43:24,127
So, they agreed and they went back,

610
00:43:24,337 --> 00:43:28,821
so Abdul Muttalib(عبد المطلب) with all of the people of Quraish(قُرَيْشْ), they came together,

611
00:43:29,165 --> 00:43:35,091
Abdullah(عبدالله) on one side, the camels on the other side, they threw the dice or the arrows

612
00:43:36,189 --> 00:43:38,596
it pointed towards Abdullah(عبدالله).

613
00:43:39,538 --> 00:43:41,083
They added another 10 camels.

614
00:43:41,466 --> 00:43:43,862
It's pointed towards Abdullah(عبدالله),

615
00:43:44,959 --> 00:43:46,253
added another 10.

616
00:43:46,443 --> 00:43:50,338
So, now we're up to 30, 40, 50, 60,

617
00:43:50,443 --> 00:43:54,276
and it's pointing towards Abdullah(عبدالله) all the way, until a 100.

618
00:43:54,721 --> 00:43:59,580
They had 100 camels on one side Abdullah(عبدالله) on the other side, finally it pointed towards the camels.

619
00:43:59,826 --> 00:44:01,244
 The people of Quraish(قُرَيْشْ) said:

620
00:44:01,530 --> 00:44:05,648
Finally, we can release your son Abdul Muttalib(عبد المطلب) said not yet.

621
00:44:06,554 --> 00:44:07,731
We'll have to do it another time.

622
00:44:08,752 --> 00:44:11,059
Cast lots the second time, cast lot the third time,

623
00:44:11,195 --> 00:44:14,242
it was consistently pointing towards the camels.

624
00:44:14,792 --> 00:44:19,569
So, he slaughtered the hundred camels and he had to pay for it all.

625
00:44:20,657 --> 00:44:24,998
And Abdul Muttalib(عبد المطلب) was a very generous man, he refused to take any of that meat,

626
00:44:25,768 --> 00:44:28,030
he gave it out and there was so much meat,

627
00:44:28,641 --> 00:44:31,580
that there was so much and the people would, take so much of it,

628
00:44:31,605 --> 00:44:35,136
but there was still enough to feed the birds and to feed the beasts.

629
00:44:35,728 --> 00:44:37,824
So later on, they would say: Ya'ani(يعني)

630
00:44:37,927 --> 00:44:43,459
it became famous among the Arabs that Abdul Muttalib(عبد المطلب) is the one, who fed the humans and the animals.

631
00:44:44,117 --> 00:44:45,354
مطعم اَطَّيْرْ فِيْ السَّمَاء

632
00:44:45,560 --> 00:44:48,209
He's the one who even fed the birds in the sky.

633
00:44:48,935 --> 00:44:52,472
And we'll talk about an incident when this saying was brought up,

634
00:44:52,919 --> 00:44:56,395
in a conversation with Abu Bakr(ابو بكر) and one leader of a clan.

635
00:44:57,887 --> 00:44:59,686
Now, the people of Quraish(قُرَيْشْ) were right,

636
00:44:59,763 --> 00:45:02,262
when they told Abdul Muttalib(عبد المطلب) if you kill your son,

637
00:45:02,562 --> 00:45:05,160
it will become a tradition among the Arabs after you,

638
00:45:05,609 --> 00:45:10,887
because when Abdul Muttalib(عبد المطلب) sacrificed a 100 camels to save his son,

639
00:45:11,506 --> 00:45:14,697
the blood money among them changed from 10 camels to 100,

640
00:45:16,340 --> 00:45:18,506
because of what happened with Abdul Muttalib(عبد المطلب).

641
00:45:18,736 --> 00:45:23,310
So, the retribution now that is paid was 100 rather than 10.

642
00:45:23,570 --> 00:45:26,826
And by the way, this tradition was kept and reserved by Islam.

643
00:45:27,221 --> 00:45:30,198
So, the Diya(ديعا) is still today 100 camels,

644
00:45:30,379 --> 00:45:34,933
however now, they would calculate it in terms of currency,

645
00:45:35,097 --> 00:45:36,990
but it is still based on that concept.

646
00:45:38,784 --> 00:45:40,324
This is the story of Abdullah(عبدالله).

647
00:45:41,975 --> 00:45:47,586
Now, Abdullah(عبدالله) and Aamna(آمنه) are the parents of Rasool Allah ﷺ.

648
00:45:48,062 --> 00:45:53,940
Later on, they would tell Muhammadﷺ that you are the son of the two sacrificed ones.

649
00:45:54,435 --> 00:45:55,648
And who are they.?

650
00:45:56,469 --> 00:45:58,176
Who are the two sacrifice one's.?

651
00:45:59,348 --> 00:46:01,006
Ismail(اِسْماعِيْل) and Abdullah(عبدالله).

652
00:46:02,022 --> 00:46:05,034
So, Rasool Allah ﷺ is the son of the two sacrifice ones,

653
00:46:05,193 --> 00:46:11,586
his father Abdullah(عبدالله) was sacrificed and his father Ismail عليه السلام was sacrificed.

654
00:46:12,641 --> 00:46:15,411
Abdullah(عبدالله) married Aamna Bint Wahb(آمنه بنت وهب).

655
00:46:16,125 --> 00:46:20,174
And we're done with the ancestry of Rasool Allah ﷺ.

656
00:46:23,451 --> 00:46:27,560
صَلَّى الله عَلى سَيَّدِنَا محمد وَعَلى اَلِهِ وَ صَحْبِهِ وَسَلِّمْ تَسْلِيْمًاكَثِيْرَا

